# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Find and add spacetime Pauli checks {#2-find-and-add-spacetime-pauli-checks}"
msgstr "2. Maghanap at magdagdag ng spacetime Pauli checks {#2-find-and-add-spacetime-pauli-checks}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`add_pauli_checks` searches for effective, low-weight checks on each target qubit and adds them to the circuit, returning a sequence of `CheckedCircuit` instances. The `CheckedCircuit` instances contain increasing numbers of checks, from ``0`` checks up to one check per target qubit. Each check improves error detection capability at the cost of a slightly increased circuit depth. For this example we will use the circuit with a check on every target qubit.\n"
msgstr "Ang `add_pauli_checks` ay naghahanap ng epektibo at low-weight na mga check sa bawat target qubit at idinadagdag ang mga ito sa circuit, at nagbabalik ng sequence ng mga `CheckedCircuit` instance. Ang mga `CheckedCircuit` instance ay may paparaming bilang ng checks, mula sa ``0`` checks hanggang isang check bawat target qubit. Pinapabuti ng bawat check ang kakayahang mag-detect ng error kapalit ng bahagyang pagtaas ng circuit depth. Sa halimbawang ito, gagamitin natin ang circuit na may check sa bawat target qubit.\n"

