# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Sample the checked circuit {#3-sample-the-checked-circuit}"
msgstr "3. I-sample ang circuit na may checks {#3-sample-the-checked-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before we sample, we transpile the checked circuit onto physical qubits (`initial_layout = layout + ancilla_qubits`) and into `ibm_boston`'s native basis gate set. To emulate a noisy QPU, we sample with a noisy Aer stabilizer backend whose error rates match the `noise_model` used to pick checks.\n"
msgstr "Bago tayo mag-sample, ita-transpile natin ang circuit na may checks papunta sa mga pisikal na qubit (`initial_layout = layout + ancilla_qubits`) at sa native basis gate set ng `ibm_boston`. Para gayahin ang maingay na QPU, nagsa-sample tayo gamit ang maingay na Aer stabilizer backend na ang mga error rate ay tugma sa `noise_model` na ginamit sa pagpili ng mga check.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Postselect samples with no detected error {#4-postselect-samples-with-no-detected-error}"
msgstr "4. I-postselect ang mga sample na walang natukoy na error {#4-postselect-samples-with-no-detected-error}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`get_postselection_method` maps each shot to its syndrome vector; we keep only the shots with an all-zero syndrome &mdash; those in which no check detected an error. Discarding the flagged shots removes detected errors from the surviving distribution, improving its fidelity at the cost of a lower sampling rate. See the [tutorial](/tutorials/spacetime-codes) for a quantitative fidelity comparison.\n"
msgstr "Ang `get_postselection_method` ay nagma-map ng bawat shot sa syndrome vector nito; pinapanatili lang natin ang mga shot na may all-zero syndrome &mdash; yung mga hindi nakatukoy ng error ang anumang check. Ang pagtatapon ng mga na-flag na shot ay nag-aalis ng mga natukoy na error sa natitirang distribution, na nagpapabuti ng fidelity nito kapalit ng mas mababang sampling rate. Tingnan ang [tutorial](/tutorials/spacetime-codes) para sa quantitative na paghahambing ng fidelity.\n"
